\chapter{Fabrication Package}

\section{Overview}

This fabrication package defines the manufacturing specifications, PCB stackups,
mechanical tolerances, assembly instructions, and compliance requirements for
the production of the MPS--PCE hardware platform. All parameters herein are
validated under deterministic timing, thermal, and electrical constraints.

